# Split-context reviewers

ops-excellence, adversary, and conformance reviewers launch as a NEW Task.
Parent must not reuse the implementer chat/session. Reviewer prompt is
packet_id + current artifact digests + oracle command only — no implementer
JSON or pass-claims. Child prose is not gate evidence.

`independent_review` requires `execution_target: isolated_copy` on a parent-
provisioned fresh site checkout of the claimed revision (not the implementer
tree). Reviewers do not follow the implementer into OpenShell or
`cloud_subagent`. Isolation green is not PASS; run
`scripts/harness/{verify,adversarial}.sh`.
